WEBVTT

00:26:58.538 --> 00:27:01.496
for me to decide that it's
time to leave this job

00:27:01.829 --> 00:27:03.996
or time to walk away from this culture.

00:27:04.329 --> 00:27:07.329
I totally agree. It's almost
like principles, right?

00:27:07.371 --> 00:27:10.038
It's like what are my values
and principles that

00:27:10.204 --> 00:27:12.204
I don't want to compromise on?

00:27:12.579 --> 00:27:16.496
And it's it's very helpful to have
some sort of moral compass

00:27:16.496 --> 00:27:21.204
or some sort of fixed point in terms of
one's value system to guide you when

00:27:21.204 --> 00:27:22.788
the decisions become very fraught.

00:27:23.454 --> 00:27:25.079
So Foghorn gets the green light.

00:27:25.413 --> 00:27:26.954
Kathee sets her kill signal

00:27:27.454 --> 00:27:29.913
for this project to be successful
in today's market,